{"t":"Crimson Offering","s":"crimson-offering-aeaa4","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Tainted_Heart_14f22e.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Crimson Offering</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">13.20.13560<br/>July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Crimson Offering</b> is a process introduced with the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a> through which players who defeated the final boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a> can obtain <a href=\"#/wiki/Sanguine%20Set\">Sanguine Set</a> equipment. \n</p><p>While hunting in the Rotten Blood areas under the influence of <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore%27s%20Taints\">Bakragore's Taints</a>, players can collect very rare drops that can be offered to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Altar%20%28NPC%29\">Altar</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Vestibule\">Blood Vestibule</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>5 <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Heart\"><img alt=\"Tainted Heart\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tainted_Heart_14f22e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Heart\">Tainted Hearts</a></li>\n<li>5 <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Heart\"><img alt=\"Darklight Heart\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darklight_Heart_dc77c8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Heart\">Darklight Hearts</a></li>\n<li>50,000,000 gps</li></ul>\n<p>As a reward, they will get a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bag%20You%20Covet\"><img alt=\"Bag You Covet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bag_You_Covet_31d037.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bag%20You%20Covet\">Bag You Covet</a>, which contains one piece of sanguine gear.\n</p><p>Although players can reach the Blood Vestibule at any time, only players who have defeated <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a> at least once can make the offerings.\n</p></div>","quests":["decaying-defender-outfits-quest","rotten-blood-quest"]}